@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

title RTB Request Flow — API Gateway (Protocol Adapter)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle


actor "DSP" as dsp

component "Load Balancer\n(L4/L7)" as lb

' Edge Proxy (Envoy) - слой L4/L7
component "Edge Proxy\n(Envoy)" as envoy

' RTB Adapter - слой L4/L7
component "RTB Adapter\n(Go/C++)" as adapter

component "Bidding Service\n(C++/Go)" as bidding

database "Redis\n(Campaigns\nCreatives\nRules)" as redis


dsp -> lb : "HTTPS / OpenRTB\n(JSON)"
lb -> envoy : "HTTPS / OpenRTB\nBid Request (JSON)"
envoy -> adapter : "HTTP / OpenRTB\nBid Request (JSON)"
adapter -> bidding : "gRPC / Bid Request"
bidding -> redis : "In-Memory\n(Чтение кампаний)"
bidding --> adapter : "gRPC / Bid Response"
adapter --> envoy : "HTTP / OpenRTB\nBid Response (JSON)"
envoy --> lb : "HTTPS / OpenRTB\nBid Request (JSON)"
lb --> dsp : "HTTPS / OpenRTB (JSON)"


note right of envoy
  **Зона ответственности:**
  - TLS Termination
  - Auth (API Keys/JWT)
  - Rate Limiting (Token Bucket)
  - Circuit Breaker
  - Метрики
end note

note right of adapter
  **Зона ответственности:**
  - Десериализация JSON
  - Нормализация моделей DSP
  - Сборка Protobuf
  - Сериализация ответов
  
  **Stateless и легко масштабируются горизонтально**
end note

note bottom of bidding
  **Stateless и легко масштабируются горизонтально**
end note

@enduml